      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/Central_Retail_Park%2C_Chapel_Park%2C_Kirkcaldy_-_geograph.org.uk_-_721634.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
